        <footnote id="F1">This Form 4 reports securities disposed of under the Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated May 12, 2026 (the &quot;Merger Agreement&quot;), by and among the Issuer, SpringX Holdings Limited (&quot;Parent&quot;), AutumnX Holdings Limited (&quot;Holdco&quot;), a wholly-owned subsidiary of Parent and SummerX Holdings Limited (&quot;Merger Sub&quot;), a wholly-owned subsidiary of Holdco. Pursuant to be Merger Agreement, Merger Sub was merged with and into the Issuer (the &quot;Merger&quot;), with the Issuer being the surviving company of the Merger as a wholly-owned subsidiary of Holdco. Upon completion of the Merger, the Issuer became a privately-held company.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">In connection with the Merger, Flawless Success Limited entered into a support agreement, dated as of May 12, 2026 (the &quot;Support Agreement&quot;), pursuant to which, among other things, at the effective time of the Merger (the &quot;Effective Time&quot;), each of these class A ordinary shares, with par value of US$0.0001 each, of the Issuer (each a &quot;Class A Ordinary Share&quot; and collectively, the &quot;Class A Ordinary Shares&quot;), reported in this row and beneficially owned by Mr. Sun Changxun was cancelled in exchange for one ordinary share newly issued by HoldCo.</footnote>
